{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/918960-gaming-table-preference","id":918960,"title":"Gaming table preference..","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-21T23:20:11-07:00","id":918960,"title":"Gaming table preference..","content":"So for when you game Table top face to face, do you prefer using a round table? Oblong one? Oval one? Square/rectangular one?<br /> What do you prefer for it's topping? None? Felt covering? Plexiglass with hexes/squares on it? <br /> Do you prefer sitting in the middle or at one of the ends?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T04:04:18-07:00","id":919023,"title":"","content":"I prefer sitting at the end of a rectangular table when I am running a game because I can then see everyone else at the table while I have my neck in a neutral position. Other shapes of table that allow the same view are fine, but don't match as well to the form-factor of the vinyl mat or poster board that sits at the center of the table for useful visual representation.<br /> <br /> When I'm not running the game, I like sitting in the middle of a side of the table so I am in a great position to do the sort of things that I ask players to help me out with while I'm running a game (such as drawing stuff, moving markers/minis, or arranging the next visual aid).<br /> <br /> My ideal setup is one that I will (eventually) build myself that has a high resolution digital display (a tv, for example) built into the middle of the table's surface with a rim around that large enough to keep books, character sheets, dice and pencils from encroaching upon the display area, and to comfortably sit myself and eight players - so I can get the best of both the face-to-face and virtual tabletop worlds.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Not so noble anymore.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1823-drake","name":"Drake","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1823_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"456"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T05:21:30-07:00","id":919042,"title":"","content":"For VTM and other RP heavy games we don't use a table, just us sitting on couches, or even the floor. If we're using minis for another game then we have two fold out tables that make a 6x6 square table but honestly, we haven't used any minis in a really long time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10575-lilappleblossom","name":"lilappleblossom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-22T06:49:37-07:00","id":919069,"title":"","content":"I like the setup we have in our game room. I currently GM, so I'll describe everything from my perspective. There's a nice oval conference table with me on one end. Directly behind me is a large whiteboard that I can draw maps or diagrams, or write the names of new/important NPCs on. Easily at hand on my right is a minifridge. Whichever player sits there ends up as potion jockey for the players. Easily at hand on my left is a bookshelf, with all my WTA, MET, and Earthdawn books. Most of the players will sit at the table, but there is also a couch at the end if someone has an emergency at work, or just needs more personal space tonight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T02:12:29-07:00","id":921408,"title":"","content":"Most of my games use our game room, which has a round table. One is at a friends house with a long rectangle table, one has no table beyond a small coffee table I put pics on.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-worl